  <a href=\"#\" class=\"icon-delete\"></a>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"ad4\"><p>【官網系統維護期間票務訂購異動說明】</p><p><br />08/12(三)10:30 至 15:30 將進行官網「影城臨櫃付款」系統維護作業。維護期間，官網平台暫時無法訂購「影城臨櫃付款」之票種，包含：團體電影優待票、愛心票、敬老票與免費兌換券。</p><p><br />維護期間如您有以下票種訂票需求，請參考替代方案：<br />✅  愛心票、敬老票、未過期團體電影優待票：請改用「官方 App 」進行訂購。<br />✅ 免費兌換券、已過期團體電影優待票：請親洽全台「影城臨櫃」劃位使用。</p><p>🟡官網「線上即時付款」之票種仍維持正常服務。</p><p><br />維護期間造成您的不便，敬請見諒，威秀影城感謝您的支持與配合。</p></div>\r\n            \r\n        </section>\r\n    </div>\r\n    \r\n    <div id=\"top\"></div>\r\n\r\n    \r\n    <!--公告圖片的燈箱--><!-- Popup區塊 [start] -->\r\n    <div class=\"liveAD\">\r\n    <!-- 燈箱開啟區塊 [start] -->\r\n    <!-- Root element of PhotoSwipe. Must have class pswp. -->\r\n    <div id=\"gallery\" class=\"pswp\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <div class=\"pswp__bg\"></div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"pswp__scroll-wrap\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"pswp__container\">\r\n                <div class=\"pswp__item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"pswp__zoom-wrap\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"pswp__item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"pswp__zoom-wrap\"></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"pswp__item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"pswp__zoom-wrap\"></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"pswp__ui pswp__ui--fit pswp__ui--hidden\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"pswp__top-bar\">\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"pswp__counter\"></div>\r\n\r\n                    <button class=\"pswp__button pswp__button--close\" title=\"Close (Esc)\"></button>\r\n\r\n                    <button class=\"pswp__button pswp__button--share\" title=\"Share\"></button>\r\n\r\n                    <button class=\"pswp__button pswp__button--fs\" title=\"Toggle fullscreen\"></button>\r\n\r\n                    <button class=\"pswp__button pswp__button--zoom\" title=\"Zoom in/out\